@startuml
title JD Processing Sequence - Core Platform Service

actor Student

participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "JDController" as Controller
participant "JDServiceImpl" as JDService
participant "StudentRepository" as StudentRepo
participant "JDRepository" as JDRepo
participant "CoreMessageProducer" as Producer
queue "RabbitMQ" as RabbitMQ
participant "Dashboard Service" as Dashboard
participant "AI Engine Service" as AI
participant "CoreMessageConsumer" as Consumer

== 1. Student creates JD ==

Student -> Gateway: POST /api/core/jds
Gateway -> Controller: CreateJDRequest

Controller -> JDService: createJD(request)

== 2. Validate Student ==

JDService -> StudentRepo: findById(studentId)

alt Student not found

    StudentRepo --> JDService: Empty
    JDService --> Controller: Student not found
    Controller --> Gateway: HTTP 404
    Gateway --> Student: Error response

else Student exists

    StudentRepo --> JDService: Student

    == 3. Create & Save JD ==

    JDService -> JDService: Build JD entity
    JDService -> JDService: status = PENDING

    JDService -> JDRepo: save(jd)
    JDRepo --> JDService: savedJD

    == 4. Notify Dashboard ==

    JDService -> Producer: sendJDAddEvent(JDAddRequest)

    Producer -> RabbitMQ: Publish JDAddRequest\nroutingKey = jd.add.request

    RabbitMQ -> Dashboard: JDAddRequest

    note right of Dashboard
        Dashboard only receives
        event for aggregation/reporting.
        No JD business processing.
    end note

    Dashboard --> RabbitMQ: ACK

    == 5. Request JD Preprocessing ==

    JDService -> Producer: sendJDPreprocessingRequest(\nJDPreprocessingRequest)

    Producer -> RabbitMQ: Publish JDPreprocessingRequest\nroutingKey = jd.preprocessing.request

    RabbitMQ -> AI: JDPreprocessingRequest

    note right of AI
        AI Engine preprocesses JD:
        - Extract information
        - Normalize data
        - Structure JD content
    end note

    AI --> RabbitMQ: ACK

    == 6. Return initial response ==

    JDService --> Controller: JDResponse\nstatus = PENDING
    Controller --> Gateway: HTTP 200
    Gateway --> Student: JDResponse

end


== 7. AI preprocessing ==

AI -> AI: Process JD rawContent
AI -> AI: Generate structuredContent

== 8. AI returns preprocessing result ==

alt Preprocessing successful

    AI -> RabbitMQ: JDPreprocessingResult\nsuccess = true

else Preprocessing failed

    AI -> RabbitMQ: JDPreprocessingResult\nsuccess = false\nerrorMessage

end

RabbitMQ -> Consumer: jd.preprocessing.completed

== 9. Core handles preprocessing result ==

Consumer -> JDService: handlePreprocessingCompleted(result)

JDService -> JDRepo: findById(jdId)
JDRepo --> JDService: JD

alt result.success = true

    JDService -> JDService: Set structuredContent
    JDService -> JDService: Set status = COMPLETED
    JDService -> JDService: Update updatedAt

    JDService -> JDRepo: save(jd)
    JDRepo --> JDService: Updated JD

else result.success = false

    JDService -> JDService: Set status = FAILED
    JDService -> JDService: Handle errorMessage
    JDService -> JDService: Update updatedAt

    JDService -> JDRepo: save(jd)
    JDRepo --> JDService: Updated JD

end

JDService --> Consumer: Processing completed

@enduml